"┌─[1]─St┌ Keybindings ─ Jobs ───────────────────────────────────────────┐──────┐"
"│◐ dev →│  j/↓  next job                                                │ult   │"
"│3 of 3 │  k/↑  previous job                                            │UNNING│"
"│◐ 1 · ✗│   ^D  ten jobs down                                           │UCCESS│"
"└───────│   ^U  ten jobs up                                             │AILED │"
"┌─[2]─Jo│    g  first job                                               │      │"
"│ 2h ◐ [│    G  last job                                                │      │"
"│ 1d ✗ n│    /  filter by name                                          │      │"
"│    · w│    m  toggle mine only                                        │      │"
"│       │    f  cycle status: all, failed, active                       │      │"
"│       │    F  filter menu: status, mine only, clear text              │      │"
"│       │    v  start or end a range; x then acts on every row          │      │"
"│       │Enter  focus the main panel                                    │      │"
"└───────│    x  actions menu: run, pause schedule, repair, cancel       │      │"
"┌─[3]─Pi│    r  refresh jobs                                            │      │"
"│       │    o  open job in browser                                     │──────┘"
"│       │    y  copy: URL, job ID, name, JSON                           │──────┐"
"│       │    Y  copy the job list as text                               │  84ms│"
"└───────│    s  cycle sort: activity, name, created                     │ 131ms│"
"┌─[4]─Co│  0-4  focus panel by number                                   │      │"
"│       │  Tab  next side panel                                         │      │"
"│       │    R  refresh everything                                      │      │"
"└───────│    +  cycle screen mode                                       │──────┘"
